| Ecosystem | Forward graph | Reverse/why lookup |
|---|---|---|
| npm | `npm ls --all --json` | `npm explain <pkg>` |
| yarn | `yarn list --json` | `yarn why <pkg>` |
| pnpm | `pnpm list --depth Infinity --json` | `pnpm why <pkg>` |
| pip | `pipdeptree --json-tree` | `pipdeptree --reverse --packages <pkg>` |
| poetry | `poetry show --tree` | `poetry show --why <pkg>` (plugin-dependent) |
| Maven | `mvn dependency:tree -Dverbose` | grep tree output for target, or `mvn dependency:tree -Dincludes=<pkg>` |
| Gradle | `./gradlew <mod>:dependencies` | `./gradlew <mod>:dependencyInsight --dependency <pkg>` |
| NuGet | `dotnet list package --include-transitive` | cross-reference `packages.lock.json` |
